---
import MacWindow from './MacWindow.jsx';
---

<section id="about" class="my-12">
  <MacWindow title="About_Me.txt" client:visible>
    <div class="space-y-4 font-pixelify text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="font-pixeboy text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide border-b-2 border-black pb-1">
        BACKGROUND & DISCOVERY
      </h2>
      
      <p>
        I'm a final-semester <mark class="bg-[var(--color-mac-yellow)] px-1">Software Engineering student</mark> and self-directed app builder[cite: 1]. Before diving headfirst into full-stack application development, I explored various fields—graphic design interning, illustration, database work, and freelance proofreading/translation[cite: 1].
      </p>
      
      <p>
        That diverse exploration wasn't indecision; it was deliberate self-discovery[cite: 1]. It taught me product taste, UI precision, and how data structures fit together[cite: 1]. Today, I apply all of it toward building high-quality mobile and web experiences[cite: 1].
      </p>
    </div>
  </MacWindow>
</section>